<section class="hero haanelHero" id="top"><div class="orb orbOne"></div><div class="orb orbTwo"></div><div class="heroCopy"><p class="eyebrow">CHARLES F. HAANEL’S MASTER KEY SYSTEM · GUIDED BY TARIQ SADDIQUE</p><h1><span>Charles F. Haanel revealed the Master Key.</span><em>Tariq helps you use it.</em></h1><p class="lead">Discover the progressive 24-part system that has challenged students for more than a century—then experience how focused coaching turns its principles into disciplined daily action.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="#free-taster">Try the free 7-day taster <span>→</span></a><a class="secondary" href="#meet-tariq">Meet Tariq, your guide</a></div><div class="trust"><span>◇ The original 24-part system</span><span>◉ Live coaching on Zoom</span><span>◎ English worldwide</span></div></div><div class="heroVisual dualPortraits"><figure class="authorityPortrait haanelAuthority"><img src="/images/master-key-wisdom.png" alt="Charles F. Haanel, author of The Master Key System"/><figcaption><span>THE ORIGINAL SYSTEM</span><strong>Charles F. Haanel</strong><small>Author · Businessman · 1866–1949</small></figcaption></figure><figure class="authorityPortrait tariqAuthority"><img src="/images/tariq-happiness-harmony.png" alt="Tariq Saddique, Master Key System coach"/><figcaption><span>YOUR MODERN GUIDE</span><strong>Tariq Saddique</strong><small>Coach · Mentor · Accountability partner</small></figcaption></figure></div></section>
