$progressionHtml = @'
<section class="weeklyProgression section" id="weekly-progression"><div class="sectionIntro centered"><p class="eyebrow">THE TRANSFORMATION IS IN THE PROGRESSION</p><h2>The power unfolds week by week.</h2><p>Each weekly lesson builds upon the last—deepening your awareness, strengthening your concentration and turning powerful ideas into lived practice.</p></div><div class="progressionGrid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Notice</h3><p>Become aware of the thoughts, reactions and repeated patterns that normally operate unnoticed.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Practise</h3><p>Train attention through a deliberate daily exercise, building on the mental faculty developed the week before.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Become</h3><p>Turn repeated practice into calmer choices, stronger self-trust and purposeful action in everyday life.</p></article></div><blockquote>As you move deeper into <em>The Master Key System</em>, an almost magical process can begin to unfold: you notice more, respond differently and act with greater intention.</blockquote><p class="progressionNote">It can feel magical, but it is not instant magic. The change comes from disciplined study, progressive practice and your willingness to apply each lesson.</p></section><section class="meetTariq section" id="meet-tariq"><figure><img src="/images/tariq-happiness-harmony.png" alt="Tariq Saddique, your Master Key System guide" loading="lazy"/></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM TIMELESS KNOWLEDGE TO LIVED EXPERIENCE</p><h2>Haanel created the system. Tariq helps you live it.</h2><p>The book gives you the principles. My coaching gives you the structure, explanation and accountability to keep moving when the work becomes deeper—and when old habits try to pull you back.</p><div class="coachValue"><span>Clear weekly teaching</span><span>Guided mental exercises</span><span>Honest accountability</span><span>Practical application</span></div><p>I will help you study each lesson in sequence, understand what it asks of you and connect the inner work to the goals, decisions and relationships that matter in your life.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="#free-taster">Experience my coaching free →</a><a class="secondary" href="mailto:toslondon9@gmail.com?subject=Master%20Key%20Discovery%20Call&amp;body=Hello%20Tariq%2C%0A%0AI%27d%20like%20to%20learn%20more%20about%20your%20Master%20Key%20coaching.%0A%0AMy%20main%20goal%20is%3A%20">Ask Tariq a question</a></div></div></section>
'@

